      "n": "#417·00",
      "text": "This grey knit mini-top has a soft ribbed texture and a relaxed fit that skims over your hips without clinging. Its short length highlights your waist, while the smooth fabric adds subtle dimension to your neutral palette."
    },
    {
      "n": "#549·31",
      "text": "These milky wide-leg jeans offer a comfortable, flowing silhouette that balances the fitted nature of your top. Their soft, creamy hue complements the grey tones while adding depth to your lower body."
    },
    {
      "n": "#287·03",
      "text": "The creamy leather bag has a sleek, structured shape that adds sophistication to your casual yet polished look. Its neutral tone blends seamlessly with your outfit while providing a touch of luxury."
    },
    {
      "n": "#139·03",
      "text": "These beige mesh sneakers combine comfort with style, featuring breathable fabric and a clean white sole that elevates everyday wear. Their muted tone harmonizes perfectly with the rest of your neutral ensemble."
    },
    {
      "n": "#78·26",
      "text": "This deep blue wool scarf brings richness to your cool-toned outfit, its vibrant hue standing out against the soft greys and cream. The lightweight knit drapes elegantly, adding warmth without bulk while making a bold visual statement near your face."
    }
  ]
